# ToolNet V3 has two independently deployed services.
# Use the app-specific examples:
#
#   Bot Core:       apps/bot-core/.env.example
#   Engagement API: apps/engagement-api/.env.example
#
# Keep credentials separated:
# - Bot Core owns BOT_TOKEN, ADMIN_IDS and TURSO_URL/TURSO_TOKEN.
# - Engagement API owns VIETNAMFB_API_KEY and must never receive Turso credentials.
# - ENGAGEMENT_API_TOKEN (Bot Core) must equal ENGAGEMENT_INTERNAL_TOKEN (Engagement API).
#
# This root file is retained only as a pointer; do not deploy from it.
